# The open and the close (B19, mockup #5) in the light theme with the clock
# set: RIGHT turns home to Game Boy Advance, A zooms its object and fogs it
# out over the paper while the game list draws, the title bar's heading
# slides in from the left, then the card rises and fades in. B plays it
# backwards: the card falls and fades, the heading slides out, the object
# comes back out of the fog, and home shows facing the item. Every frame of
# both is hashed and watched for tears.
#! settings 28=1
-C 1792586096
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-w "home: facing gba"
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-H @8:@32
-T @8:@32
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-s @1:page.png
-k @8:B -k @12:-
-H @8:@26
-T @8:@26
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:back.png
